  {
    "name": "nexus_search",
    "description": "有界查询当前私有记录，返回最多20条、4000字符；不含restricted。",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "domain": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "life",
            "work",
            "health",
            "unclassified"
          ]
        },
        "start": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "end": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "limit": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 20
        },
        "tag": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "entity": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "nexus_query",
    "description": "仅固定查询，不接受SQL。金额minor units需按scale还原；统计只覆盖Nexus现存记录。 档案查找group_catalog(name)；整组列表group_records(group_id,limit,cursor)，按next_cursor翻页；完整全组金额group_summary(group_id)，不受分页限制；待归组候选group_pending；当前档案group_context。complete仅指已关联的有效私有记录，不能说覆盖所有聊天。 group_snapshots检查文字快照是否需更新；group_audit分页检查缺关联/待归组/费用未整理/疑似重复。候选不是事实，不自动新增消费或合并。 group_snapshot_members(group_id,snapshot_item_id)分页查看生成汇总依据的历史记录/版本。 records_by_period/domain_summary_candidates(start含,end不含,domain,limit,cursor)：完整SQL统计total_count/categorized_counts/uncategorized，正文仅分页/代表候选；has_more为真须翻页，不能把样本当全量。日期采用valid_from，其次financial.occurred_date/schedule.start_date；无日期记录在undated_count单列、不猜日期。trip_costs兼容entity_id并统一当前group路径；financial_totals可用group_id/domain筛选，仅booked，trip_costs/group_summary分列booked/quote/budget/commitment。 历史原话核验archive_history(name=关键词,limit<=3)仅返回有限已校验本人原始归档，不把摘要当原话。 unclassified_records(limit,cursor)完整列未分类，时间未知不猜；health查询只在原文明确健康意图时展开。 未来日程用upcoming_schedules(start/end/domain/limit/cursor)，按当前schedule.start_date筛选，不包含撤销日程。",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "template": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "financial_totals",
            "open_tasks",
            "person_timeline",
            "trip_costs",
            "domain_summary_candidates",
            "records_by_period",
            "pending_status",
            "group_catalog",
            "group_context",
            "group_records",
            "group_summary",
            "group_pending",
            "group_snapshots",
            "group_audit",
            "group_snapshot_members",
            "archive_history",
            "unclassified_records",
            "upcoming_schedules"
          ]
        },
        "start": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "end": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "entity_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "group_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "limit": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 20
        },
        "cursor": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "snapshot_item_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "domain": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "领域筛选，如life/work/uncategorized。",
          "enum": [
            "life",
            "work",
            "health",
            "unclassified"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "template"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "nexus_get_source",
    "description": "读取item的已绑定少量原文，最多3 sources/3000字符；restricted不开放。",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "item_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_id": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "item_id"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "nexus_delete_preview",
    "description": "仅预览结构化记录删除影响，永不删除Archive。soft delete需另用update并保留来源。",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "item_id": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "item_id"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  }
]
